{"id":"38a37d8a0a52c221","group":"56","path":"56/56-df-parallel-labelled-reduction.md","title":"有限带红项集的平行归约","display":"df-parallel-labelled-reduction — 有限带红项集的平行归约","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","label":"56-df-parallel-labelled-reduction","aliases":["56-df-parallel-labelled-reduction"],"display":"df-parallel-labelled-reduction — 有限带红项集的平行归约","depends_on":["[[56-df-parallel-redex-contraction]]","[[56-df-labelled-reduction]]","[[56-df-position]]"],"source_section":"§8.2 Proposition 8.2.22; §8.5 Definitions 8.5.6,8.5.17","source_printed_pages":"325,365,369","source_statement_status":"compared-to-local-djvu-ocr; explicit-local-interface","source_proof_status":"read-source-proof-and-local-derivation; not-machine-formalized"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"label","html":"56-df-parallel-labelled-reduction"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-df-parallel-labelled-reduction</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-parallel-labelled-reduction — 有限带红项集的平行归约"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1e89cffc6791bf08\" href=\"?note=1e89cffc6791bf08\" title=\"56-df-parallel-redex-contraction\">56-df-parallel-redex-contraction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"971588c26e0c9fdf\" href=\"?note=971588c26e0c9fdf\" title=\"56-df-labelled-reduction\">56-df-labelled-reduction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"da02033e6d596cae\" href=\"?note=da02033e6d596cae\" title=\"56-df-position\">56-df-position</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§8.2 Proposition 8.2.22; §8.5 Definitions 8.5.6,8.5.17"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"325,365,369"},{"key":"source_statement_status","html":"compared-to-local-djvu-ocr; explicit-local-interface"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"read-source-proof-and-local-derivation; not-machine-formalized"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>固定正交系统。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T,\\mathcal E_R,\\operatorname{Red}_R,\\operatorname{ctr}_R,\\mathcal F_R,\\mathbf1_s\">\\(T,\\mathcal E_R,\\operatorname{Red}_R,\\operatorname{ctr}_R,\\mathcal F_R,\\mathbf1_s\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"971588c26e0c9fdf\" href=\"?note=971588c26e0c9fdf\" title=\"56-df-labelled-reduction\">56-df-labelled-reduction</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Disj},\\operatorname{PC}_R\">\\(\\operatorname{Disj},\\operatorname{PC}_R\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"1e89cffc6791bf08\" href=\"?note=1e89cffc6791bf08\" title=\"56-df-parallel-redex-contraction\">56-df-parallel-redex-contraction</a>。有限序列下标从0起，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi=(\\boldsymbol s,\\boldsymbol U)\">\\(\\Pi=(\\boldsymbol s,\\boldsymbol U)\\)</span> 为待判定参数；调用路径投影、区间及串行化时限定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi\\in\\mathcal P_R\">\\(\\Pi\\in\\mathcal P_R\\)</span>，并统一记 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n=L(\\Pi)\">\\(n=L(\\Pi)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s_i=\\boldsymbol s(i)\">\\(s_i=\\boldsymbol s(i)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U_i=\\boldsymbol U(i)\">\\(U_i=\\boldsymbol U(i)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi[i:j]\">\\(\\Pi[i:j]\\)</span> 的定义域为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\\le i\\le j\\le L(\\Pi)\">\\(0\\le i\\le j\\le L(\\Pi)\\)</span>。位置的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"&lt;_{\\mathrm{lex}}\">\\(&lt;_{\\mathrm{lex}}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"da02033e6d596cae\" href=\"?note=da02033e6d596cae\" title=\"56-df-position\">56-df-position</a>。下式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ord}(U)\">\\(\\operatorname{ord}(U)\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ser}_R(s,U)\">\\(\\operatorname{ser}_R(s,U)\\)</span> 仅在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\in T\">\\(s\\in T\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\\subseteq\\operatorname{Red}_R(s)\">\\(U\\subseteq\\operatorname{Red}_R(s)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Disj}(U)\">\\(\\operatorname{Disj}(U)\\)</span> 的定义域使用。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PCS}_R\\coloneqq\\{(s,U,\\operatorname{PC}_R(s,U)):s\\in T,\\ U\\in\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(\\operatorname{Red}_R(s)):\\operatorname{Disj}(B)\\}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PCS}_R\\coloneqq\\{(s,U,\\operatorname{PC}_R(s,U)):s\\in T,\\ U\\in\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(\\operatorname{Red}_R(s)):\\operatorname{Disj}(B)\\}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PFinRed}_R(\\Pi)\\iff\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists\\boldsymbol s\\in T^{n+1}\\;\\exists\\boldsymbol U\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathcal E_R)^n\\;\\bigl(\\Pi=(\\boldsymbol s,\\boldsymbol U)\\land\\forall i&lt;n\\;((s_i,U_i,s_{i+1})\\in\\operatorname{PCS}_R)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PFinRed}_R(\\Pi)\\iff\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists\\boldsymbol s\\in T^{n+1}\\;\\exists\\boldsymbol U\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathcal E_R)^n\\;\\bigl(\\Pi=(\\boldsymbol s,\\boldsymbol U)\\land\\forall i&lt;n\\;((s_i,U_i,s_{i+1})\\in\\operatorname{PCS}_R)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P_R\\coloneqq\\{\\Pi:\\operatorname{PFinRed}_R(\\Pi)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal P_R\\coloneqq\\{\\Pi:\\operatorname{PFinRed}_R(\\Pi)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"L(\\Pi)\\coloneqq|\\boldsymbol U|,\\quad S(\\Pi)\\coloneqq s_0,\\quad T(\\Pi)\\coloneqq s_{L(\\Pi)}\\qquad(\\Pi=(\\boldsymbol s,\\boldsymbol U)\\in\\mathcal P_R).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[L(\\Pi)\\coloneqq|\\boldsymbol U|,\\quad S(\\Pi)\\coloneqq s_0,\\quad T(\\Pi)\\coloneqq s_{L(\\Pi)}\\qquad(\\Pi=(\\boldsymbol s,\\boldsymbol U)\\in\\mathcal P_R).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Pi[i:j]\\coloneqq(\\langle s_i,\\ldots,s_j\\rangle,\\langle U_i,\\ldots,U_{j-1}\\rangle),\\qquad\\mathbf1^P_s\\coloneqq(\\langle s\\rangle,\\langle\\rangle).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Pi[i:j]\\coloneqq(\\langle s_i,\\ldots,s_j\\rangle,\\langle U_i,\\ldots,U_{j-1}\\rangle),\\qquad\\mathbf1^P_s\\coloneqq(\\langle s\\rangle,\\langle\\rangle).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Pi;\\Xi\\coloneqq(\\langle s_0,\\ldots,s_n,t_1,\\ldots,t_m\\rangle,\\langle U_0,\\ldots,U_{n-1},V_0,\\ldots,V_{m-1}\\rangle)\\quad(\\Xi=(\\boldsymbol t,\\boldsymbol V)\\in\\mathcal P_R,\\ n=L(\\Pi),\\ m=L(\\Xi),\\ s_n=t_0).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Pi;\\Xi\\coloneqq(\\langle s_0,\\ldots,s_n,t_1,\\ldots,t_m\\rangle,\\langle U_0,\\ldots,U_{n-1},V_0,\\ldots,V_{m-1}\\rangle)\\quad(\\Xi=(\\boldsymbol t,\\boldsymbol V)\\in\\mathcal P_R,\\ n=L(\\Pi),\\ m=L(\\Xi),\\ s_n=t_0).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{par}_R(\\rho)\\coloneqq(\\boldsymbol s,\\langle\\{u_0\\},\\ldots,\\{u_{n-1}\\}\\rangle)\\quad(\\rho=(\\boldsymbol s,\\boldsymbol u)\\in\\mathcal F_R,\\ n=\\ell(\\rho)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{par}_R(\\rho)\\coloneqq(\\boldsymbol s,\\langle\\{u_0\\},\\ldots,\\{u_{n-1}\\}\\rangle)\\quad(\\rho=(\\boldsymbol s,\\boldsymbol u)\\in\\mathcal F_R,\\ n=\\ell(\\rho)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ord}(U)\\coloneqq\\langle u_0,\\ldots,u_{k-1}\\rangle\\quad\\bigl(k=|U|,\\ \\{u_i:i&lt;k\\}=U,\\ \\forall i&lt;j&lt;k\\;(\\operatorname{pos}(u_i)&lt;_{\\mathrm{lex}}\\operatorname{pos}(u_j))\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{ord}(U)\\coloneqq\\langle u_0,\\ldots,u_{k-1}\\rangle\\quad\\bigl(k=|U|,\\ \\{u_i:i&lt;k\\}=U,\\ \\forall i&lt;j&lt;k\\;(\\operatorname{pos}(u_i)&lt;_{\\mathrm{lex}}\\operatorname{pos}(u_j))\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"k\\coloneqq|U|,\\qquad\\boldsymbol v\\coloneqq\\operatorname{ord}(U)\\in\\mathcal E_R^k.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[k\\coloneqq|U|,\\qquad\\boldsymbol v\\coloneqq\\operatorname{ord}(U)\\in\\mathcal E_R^k.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"t_0\\coloneqq s,\\qquad t_{j+1}\\coloneqq\\operatorname{ctr}_R(t_j,\\boldsymbol v(j))\\quad(0\\le j&lt;k),\\qquad\\operatorname{ser}_R(s,U)\\coloneqq(\\langle t_0,\\ldots,t_k\\rangle,\\boldsymbol v).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[t_0\\coloneqq s,\\qquad t_{j+1}\\coloneqq\\operatorname{ctr}_R(t_j,\\boldsymbol v(j))\\quad(0\\le j&lt;k),\\qquad\\operatorname{ser}_R(s,U)\\coloneqq(\\langle t_0,\\ldots,t_k\\rangle,\\boldsymbol v).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ser}_R(\\Pi)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{ser}_R(s_0,U_0);\\cdots;\\operatorname{ser}_R(s_{n-1},U_{n-1})\\quad(n&gt;0),\\qquad\\operatorname{ser}_R(\\mathbf1^P_s)\\coloneqq\\mathbf1_s.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{ser}_R(\\Pi)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{ser}_R(s_0,U_0);\\cdots;\\operatorname{ser}_R(s_{n-1},U_{n-1})\\quad(n&gt;0),\\qquad\\operatorname{ser}_R(\\mathbf1^P_s)\\coloneqq\\mathbf1_s.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ser}_R(\\Pi)\\in\\mathcal F_R,\\quad\\operatorname{src}(\\operatorname{ser}_R(\\Pi))=S(\\Pi),\\quad\\operatorname{tgt}(\\operatorname{ser}_R(\\Pi))=T(\\Pi).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{ser}_R(\\Pi)\\in\\mathcal F_R,\\quad\\operatorname{src}(\\operatorname{ser}_R(\\Pi))=S(\\Pi),\\quad\\operatorname{tgt}(\\operatorname{ser}_R(\\Pi))=T(\\Pi).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>PCS先在PC的合法不交红项集域构造单步图；PFinRed用图成员关系判定任意候选编码，不在非法U上调用部分PC。平行步保留所收缩的具体红项集，并允许空集步，不能仅凭两个端点恢复本编码。Disj使pos在U上单射到有限Pos(s)，故U有限且规则身份不重位置；位置的文本序于是唯一确定ord。串行收缩不交位置时其他红项的位置、匹配实例与规则身份不变，故ser中的每步合法；不交替换交换律给终点PC。区间和拼接保留所有空平行步。来源为本地DjVu相应章节；这是显式集合编码，不等于把任意嵌套多步当作一次平行替换。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-parallel-redex-contraction","status":"resolved","id":"1e89cffc6791bf08","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-parallel-redex-contraction]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-labelled-reduction","status":"resolved","id":"971588c26e0c9fdf","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-labelled-reduction]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-position","status":"resolved","id":"da02033e6d596cae","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-position]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-labelled-reduction","status":"resolved","id":"971588c26e0c9fdf","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定正交系统。$T,\\mathcal E_R,\\operatorname{Red}_R,\\operatorname{ctr}_R,\\mathcal F_R,\\mathbf1_s$ 见 [[56-df-labelled-reduction]]，$\\operatorname{Disj},\\operatorname{PC}_R$ 见 [[56-df-parallel-redex-contraction]]。有限序列下标从0起，$\\Pi=(\\boldsymbol s,\\boldsymbol U)$ 为待判定参数；调用路径投影、区间及串行化时限定 $\\Pi\\in\\mathcal P_R$，并统一记 $n=L(\\Pi)$、$s_i=\\boldsymbol s(i)$、$U_i=\\boldsymbol U(i)$；$\\Pi[i:j]$ 的定义域为 $0\\le i\\le j\\le L(\\Pi)$。位置的 $<_{\\mathrm{lex}}$ 见 [[56-df-position]]。下式 $\\operatorname{ord}(U)$ 与 $\\operatorname{ser}_R(s,U)$ 仅在 $s\\in T$、$U\\subseteq\\operatorname{Red}_R(s)$、$\\operatorname{Disj}(U)$ 的定义域使用。","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-parallel-redex-contraction","status":"resolved","id":"1e89cffc6791bf08","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定正交系统。$T,\\mathcal E_R,\\operatorname{Red}_R,\\operatorname{ctr}_R,\\mathcal F_R,\\mathbf1_s$ 见 [[56-df-labelled-reduction]]，$\\operatorname{Disj},\\operatorname{PC}_R$ 见 [[56-df-parallel-redex-contraction]]。有限序列下标从0起，$\\Pi=(\\boldsymbol s,\\boldsymbol U)$ 为待判定参数；调用路径投影、区间及串行化时限定 $\\Pi\\in\\mathcal P_R$，并统一记 $n=L(\\Pi)$、$s_i=\\boldsymbol s(i)$、$U_i=\\boldsymbol U(i)$；$\\Pi[i:j]$ 的定义域为 $0\\le i\\le j\\le L(\\Pi)$。位置的 $<_{\\mathrm{lex}}$ 见 [[56-df-position]]。下式 $\\operatorname{ord}(U)$ 与 $\\operat